	(text "NA sensor board (docs/DESIGN.md D-50): FR4 1.6 mm round the barrier's collar, against the wall.\nJ1: 5 V from the mains board's J2 over a 6-way 0.5 mm FFC (pinout mirror-symmetric).\nJ2 mates the MSR-2's rear connector CN2 (MSR-2 powered through its 5V pin).\nU1: SHT40, I2C on the MSR-2 bus (SDA = IO1, SCL = IO0).\nMK1: top-port PDM microphone, SELECT low; U2: ADAU7002 PDM to I2S, CONFIG high = I2S (D-83).\nI2S to the MSR-2: SCK = IO4, WS = IO6, SD = IO7. Sample rate >= 16 kHz (PDM clock 64 x fs >= 1 MHz).\nH1-H3: SMT spacers under the MSR-2's board. Copper keeps 8 mm from the box opening."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25 180 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "32927953-3314-59fb-bf75-6ab9f0faf04a")
	)
